'''Elf''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance ==
Its blade is green in color with a brown belt that has a golden buckle in the center. The guard is a shiny yellow, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia ==
* It has a [[Elf (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name, though it is from the succeeding year.

